        reserve the first 64 client pixels, with a proportionally scaled logo
        inset equally from the top and left edges.
        Menus place branding directly on the form and retain
        their footer actions. Community menus also show the DeploymentBunny logo
        beside the edition logo. Branding controls dispose their images and heading
        font when their parent form or ribbon is disposed.
    .PARAMETER Form
        Main window receiving the branding.
    .PARAMETER ScriptPath
        UI script path, used for the heading and its local Markdown guide.
    .PARAMETER CloseButton
        Existing Close button to reparent, preserving its event handlers.
    .PARAMETER Menu
        Uses the edition logo at the form's bottom left, the Community
        DeploymentBunny logo beside it, and the toolkit logo at the top right,
        without a ribbon.
    .PARAMETER Edition
        Selects the Community or Enterprise menu logo.
    .PARAMETER HelpAction
        Optional Help handler, for navigation inside the help reader.
    .PARAMETER StatusLabel
        Optional label displayed in the center of the branding row.
    .EXAMPLE
